# Legacy only. Entries used to be appended to journal/YYYY-MM-DD.md by
# several PRs at once; union kept local merges clean, but GitHub's server-side
# merge ignores it, so auto-merge stalled anyway (#168, #177). New entries are
# one file each under journal/YYYY-MM-DD/ and never share a path. Kept so a
# local merge of an old branch touching a legacy day file still unions.
journal/*.md merge=union
